  "note": "Annual election of one-third of the Ballyclare Urban Council, polled 17 May 1938. Five candidates contested three vacancies (Belfast News-Letter, 18 May 1938, p. 7). Filed on Monday 16 May 1938, the 1938 polling day for annual-thirds towns (phase-A2 calendar); this record's own note reads 17 May. (round folder corrected from \"1938-05\", 5 Nov 2026) Five candidates for three seats; Mr. Coleman was chairman of the Council. Nominations (Belfast News-Letter, 9 May 1938, p. 11) give the five names."
